4. Added error logging to the ErrorBoundary
5. Removed the I18nextProvider since it wasn't being properly configured
6. Added headers to the TRPC client configuration
7. Moved the Suspense boundary inside the providers to ensure proper context availability

The changes should resolve the TRPC initialization error by providing a properly configured TRPC instance. If you still encounter any specific errors related to TRPC operations, we might need to:

